        <mxCell id="footer-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:21.60px&quot;&gt;Note: the environment key reaches the claimed pod through SandboxClaim.spec.env (the control plane), never over the pod network; a warm pod holds no key.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:22.40px&quot;&gt;Note: the launcher intake is a ClusterIP Service with deny-all ingress; claim and release requests need the bearer token, and GET / answers a health check without one. The sandbox has no network intake (deny-all ingress).&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=-1.477;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
